Package: erodist-installer
Version: 1.0.0~rc3-mint1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: EroDist <erodist@localhost>
Depends: erodist-system, ubiquity, ubiquity-frontend-gtk
Description: EroDist edition page and package provisioning for Mint Ubiquity
 Adds an explicit edition choice before disk partitioning and provisions the
 chosen package bundle into the target during installation.
